title: "Trading Floor: an agent-based simulation of a trading-card market"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "sakisaki-dev"
version: 2.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/sakisaki-dev/trading-floor"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based simulation of a trading-card market. Neural-network bots trade cards of players from a
  simulated football league built on one Retro Bowl save's real data. Bots learn within a lifetime and evolve
  across generations; the engine records diagnostics and a tactic tracker.
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - neural networks
  - evolution
  - market simulation
